DaggerThrow.name=Dagger Throw
DaggerThrow.description=Throw a fast dagger.

Disengage.name=Disengage
Disengage.description=Leap back and throw 3 daggers in front of you.

SecondWind.name=Second Wind
SecondWind.description=Instant dash in any direction. Grants an invincibility window and refills stamina.

ShadowDash.name=Shadow Dash
ShadowDash.description=Dash forward at extreme speed. Stuns and damages enemies.

PocketBomb.name=Pocket Bomb
PocketBomb.description=Throw a bomb that deals damage and knocks back enemies.

TwinStab.name=Twin Stab
TwinStab.description=Stab twice fast directly in front of you.

Whirl.name=Whirl
Whirl.description=Dash forward and spin, dealing heavy damage to nearby enemies.

WideSlash.name=Wide Slash
WideSlash.description=Wide slash that deals damage and knocks back enemies.

BombShot.name=Bomb Shot
BombShot.description=Shoot an explosive arrow that deals area damage.

Burst.name=Burst
Burst.description=Shoot arrows repeatedly and grants movement speed.

ElectricShot.name=Electric Shot
ElectricShot.description=Shoot an electric arrow that pierces enemies and deals heavy damage.

FrostVolley.name=Frost Volley
FrostVolley.description=Shoot a volley of ice arrows that damages and slows enemies.

PoisonCloud.name=Poison Cloud
PoisonCloud.description=Shoot an arrow that creates a poison cloud, dealing area damage over time.

JumpShot.name=Jump Shot
JumpShot.description=Leap back and shoot a burst of air.

WolfForm.name=Wolf Form
WolfForm.description=Transform into a wolf and leap forward. Damages enemies and grants movement speed.

BearForm.name=Bear Form
BearForm.description=Transform into a bear and stomp. Deals heavy area damage and knocks back enemies.